From: Armada contributors
Subject: [PATCH] opd2413 sm8750 board resources

Ported from yzddmr6/linux-sm8750-erhai at
70b572544d504735e2924f6c3f5fe3bd726ef275, relative to Linux v7.2.14.
Adapted to Armada Linux 7.2.6; retain existing Armada GPU/CPU/pin definitions.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi
